true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["罗莎找上了我，希望我能用家族的神秘术来追缉这位可恶的房客。我只能遗憾地告诉她，我并不会所谓的“通灵”。我的父母都是骗子。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"103":{"step":[[103,104,""]],"type":1,"name":["《湖边的女人》","","<i>Lady by the Lake</i>","","","","",""],"head_icon":"313610.png","audio":"613500032","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["我记得这个家伙，他总是在捣鼓着一些危险的炼金术材料，自从他戴上面具之后，头脑就没有一天是清醒的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"104":{"step":[[104,167,""]],"type":1,"name":["空脑袋","","Loggerhead","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311213.png","audio":"613500527","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["也许就是他失败的炼金实验摧毁了那个厨房。可怜的罗莎！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"105":{"step":[[105,106,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"314210.png","audio":"613500217","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["<b><span style=\"color:orange\">挖掘艺术</span></b>。他尝试潜入一些政府要地，宣称要近距离观摩壁画复兴运动的巨作。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"106":{"step":[[106,107,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"314210.png","audio":"613500218","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["但因为行踪诡异，最终被巡逻的警察赶了出去。在政府就职的迪亚哥和我提过这件事。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"107":{"step":[[107,168,""]],"type":1,"name":["《湖边的女人》","","<i>Lady by the Lake</i>","","","","",""],"head_icon":"313613.png","audio":"613500033","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["那个嬉皮士，原来他还活着！自从他跟随传道者前往火地岛后，我就再也没有听过他的消息。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"108":{"step":[[108,109,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"314201.png","audio":"613500219","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["<b><span style=\"color:orange\">菲茨威廉</span></b>。他在《墨西哥城先驱周报》发表了一篇采访外交官的报道。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"109":{"step":[[109,110,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"314201.png","audio":"613500220","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["那是一篇言辞浮夸的文章，能登上本地最大的报纸，只是占了题材之便——听说为了接触这位外交官，他给对方送了不少好东西。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"110":{"step":[[110,111,""]],"type":1,"name":["《湖边的女人》","","<i>Lady by the Lake</i>","","","","",""],"head_icon":"313611.png","audio":"613500034","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["佩雷斯先生对这个贪婪的家伙厌烦极了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"111":{"step":[[111,112,""]],"type":1,"name":["《湖边的女人》","","<i>Lady by the Lake</i>","","","","",""],"head_icon":"313610.png","audio":"613500035","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["在那天，哪怕我待在仓库的角落，都能听到菲茨威廉的动静：他闯了进来，像个强盗一样带走了好多东西！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"112":{"step":[[112,113,""]],"type":1,"name":["《湖边的女人》","","<i>Lady by the Lake</i>","","","","",""],"head_icon":"313601.png","audio":"613500036","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["他要走了佩雷斯先生用作展览的黄金挂饰、神像、绿松石面具、绿咬鹃羽毛头饰……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"113":{"step":[[113,114,""]],"type":1,"name":["《湖边的女人》","","<i>Lady by the Lake</i>","","","","",""],"head_icon":"313601.png","audio":"613500037","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["最后，他又要走了几幅画，把这些东西都打包起来。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"114":{"step":[[114,115,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"115":{"step":[[115,116,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"314212.png","audio":"613500221","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["你刚刚提到了，画？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"116":{"step":[[116,117,""]],"type":1,"name":["《湖边的女人》","","<i>Lady by the Lake</i>","","","","",""],"head_icon":"313610.png","audio":"613500038","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["亲爱的，俱乐部里最不缺的就是艺术品！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"117":{"step":[[117,118,""]],"type":1,"name":["《湖边的女人》","","<i>Lady by the Lake</i>","","","","",""],"head_icon":"313611.png","audio":"613500039","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["那位外交官先生，对于即将要举办的大众艺术展非常感兴趣。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"118":{"step":[[118,119,""]],"type":1,"name":["《湖边的女人》","","<i>Lady by the Lake</i>","","","","",""],"head_icon":"313610.png","audio":"613500040","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":true,"text":["也许菲茨威廉就是借着那些描绘原住民与墨西哥神话的画作，来和对方攀上关系的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"119":{"step":[[119,120,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["所有犯罪现场的细节在女孩脑海中一一闪过。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"120":{"step":[[120,121,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["电光石火之间，如同在一团乱麻中找到了线头，她抓住了一切的关键。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_5/3_5_bg_16.jpg","choice":[]},"121":{"step":[[121,122,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500222","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我完全错了……将这一切连环案件串联起来的，并非绿松石蛇俱乐部。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"122":{"step":[[122,123,""]],"type":1,"name":["《湖边的女人》","","<i>Lady by the Lake</i>","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500041","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你说什么？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"123":{"step":[[123,124,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500223","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["最初的一起案件，发生在干旱的荒郊中。一位流浪汉在沙漠中溺水，他的死状引起了警察注意，最终此案被转移至夜巡特遣管理局。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"124":{"step":[[124,125,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500224","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["第二起案件，发生在一位富商的玻璃房内。由于在死亡后跌入了生态缸，他被自己违法饲养的魔精撕成了碎片。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"125":{"step":[[125,126,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500225","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["第三起，则在一处人来人往的开放广场。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"126":{"step":[[126,127,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500226","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["第四起与第五起，分别发生在修道院与文化公寓里。除了死状，执夜人在这些案件中间找不到任何相似之处。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"127":{"step":[[127,128,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500227","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但其实，真正的关键，就明晃晃地躺在流浪汉聚集的垃圾场，挂在修道院的办公室，绘制在广场的外墙上——","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"128":{"step":[[128,129,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500228","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["莱瑟姆，你还记得我们在第五处案发现场的灶台里找到的布条吗？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"129":{"step":[[129,130,""]],"type":1,"name":["空脑袋","","Loggerhead","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500528","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["噢，我记得！你说的是那个绘制着三个符号的布条？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"130":{"step":[[130,131,""]],"type":1,"name":["空脑袋","","Loggerhead","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500529","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["后来我们发现，那是绿松石蛇俱乐部的符号，所以我们才会前往拍卖会寻找线索。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"131":{"step":[[131,132,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500229","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["是的，但其实重点并非在那个符号，而是布条本身。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"132":{"step":[[132,133,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500230","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那是亚麻布——它是一张油画布。那张烧焦的布条，是某张画作遗留下来的一部分。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"133":{"step":[[133,134,""]],"type":1,"name":["空脑袋","","Loggerhead","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500530","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那第六起案件呢？那位参加拍卖会的母亲，她是在我们身边遇害的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"134":{"step":[[134,135,""]],"type":6,"name":["空脑袋","","Loggerhead","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500531","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["在当时，我们身边并没有任何画作——","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"135":{"step":[[135,136,""]],"type":1,"name":["空脑袋","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"311201.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["机械女孩忽然顿住了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"136":{"step":[[136,137,""]],"type":1,"name":["空脑袋","","Loggerhead","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500532","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["不对。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"137":{"step":[[137,138,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"613500231","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你发现了。我们竟然忽视了如此明显的线索：那位观众遇害时，台上正在进行着画作的拍卖。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"138":{"step":[[138,139,""]],"type":1,"name":["拉莫纳","","Ramona","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"6135